#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:321
msgid "What the two governors do"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/AdminDashboard.php:323
msgid "While the focus governor is on, every element that receives keyboard focus gets a visible outline in the configured ring colour and a scroll margin, so sticky headers and footers do not cover it. While the motion governor is on, animations and transitions collapse to 0.001 ms whenever the visitor has enabled Reduced Motion in the operating system. Both are CSS printed into the site head; the plugin does not audit or change the theme itself."
msgstr ""

